    - *Moirai-1*: Encoder-only; **Any-Variate Attention**; mixture-distribution output.
    - *Moirai-2.0 (2025)*: Decoder-only; quantile outputs; small version 11M params (30x smaller, 2x faster than v1-Large).
  - **Time-MoE**: Decoder-only; **Sparse MoE routing**; 2.4B params; probabilistic output.
